{"title": "Cooked Food Supply Table 10", "pageid": 13789, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Cooked_Food_Supply_Table_10", "categories": ["Drop tables", "Food supply tables"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The <b>Cooked Food Supply Table 10</b>, also known as <code>Supplies_Food_10_Cooked</code>&nbsp;<span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Supplies_Food_10_Cooked+type:treasuretable\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Supplies_Food_10_Cooked+type:treasuretable\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span>, is a non-leveled <a href=\"/wiki/Treasure_Table\" title=\"Treasure Table\">Treasure Table</a> containing large cooked <a href=\"/wiki/Camp_Supplies\" title=\"Camp Supplies\">Camp Supplies</a>.\n</p><p>Its name seems to be based on the fact that the average Supplies value of this table is approximately 10.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Drop_Table\">Drop Table</span></h2>\n<p><i>The following section can be transcluded into other pages with <code>{{:Cooked Food Supply Table 10}}</code>.</i>\n</p><p><i>The average roll on <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Cooked Food Supply Table 10</a> is worth 10.4 <a href=\"/wiki/Camp_Supplies\" title=\"Camp Supplies\">Camp Supplies</a>.</i>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n  <th colspan=\"2\">Item</th>\n  <th>Quantity</th>\n  <th>Chance</th>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n\n\n<th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 0.4rem\" colspan=\"2\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Black_Pudding_Platter\" title=\"Black Pudding Platter\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a5/FOOD_Hearty_Dinner_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-FOOD_Hearty_Dinner_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a5/FOOD_Hearty_Dinner_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-FOOD_Hearty_Dinner_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/a/a5/FOOD_Hearty_Dinner_Unfaded_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a5/FOOD_Hearty_Dinner_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-FOOD_Hearty_Dinner_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a5/FOOD_Hearty_Dinner_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Black_Pudding_Platter\" title=\"Black Pudding Platter\">Black Pudding Platter</a></span> </th>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">1</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">1/5</td></tr>\n<tr>\n\n\n<th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 0.4rem\" colspan=\"2\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fragrant_Fungus_Stew\" title=\"Fragrant Fungus Stew\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/FOOD_Murky_Stew_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-FOOD_Murky_Stew_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/FOOD_Murky_Stew_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-FOOD_Murky_Stew_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/FOOD_Murky_Stew_Unfaded_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/FOOD_Murky_Stew_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-FOOD_Murky_Stew_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/FOOD_Murky_Stew_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Fragrant_Fungus_Stew\" title=\"Fragrant Fungus Stew\">Fragrant Fungus Stew</a></span> </th>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">1</td>\n<td